'''Vivillon''' (Japanese: '''ビビヨン''' ''Viviyon'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

