==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{form|Vivillon|Meadow Pattern}} {{p|Vivillon}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Battle Styles|Vivillon|13}} from the {{TCG|Battle Styles}} expansion.
*'''Vivid Powder''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Vivillon|8}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

